#: includes/class-sajn-admin.php:351
msgid "Other keys"
msgstr "Andra nycklar"

#: includes/class-sajn-admin.php:354
msgid "One key per line, such as \"org-number = {org-nr}\". Use this for keys the list above doesn't show, such as form fields in an uploaded PDF."
msgstr "En nyckel per rad, till exempel \"org-number = {org-nr}\". Använd det för nycklar som listan ovan inte visar, till exempel formulärfält i en uppladdad PDF."

#: includes/class-sajn-admin.php:359
